    "description": "*As a* application user\n\n*I want* to be able to export my data in CSV format\n\n*So that* I can analyze it using external tools\n\n\n\n*Actual Behavior*\n * The export feature currently only supports PDF format\n\n*Scope*\n * All registered users\n\n*Acceptance criteria*\n * Users can select CSV as an export format\n * The exported CSV contains all relevant data fields\n * The CSV file is properly formatted with headers\n * Large datasets are exported efficiently without timeout\n\n+*Comments:*+\n * This feature has been requested by multiple users in user feedback surveys",
